OL,3,GNEWSATeacher tells jury naked photo was
OL,4,Ataken by pupil's spy cam               
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains         
OL,7,Fdistressing details.                   
OL,9,FA former boarding school teacher claims
OL,10,Fa photo showing him naked on his bed   
OL,11,Fwas taken by a student with a "James   
OL,12,FBond"-style spy camera, a court has    
OL,13,Fbeen told.                             
OL,15,FDerek Barker, 92, denies eight sexual  
OL,16,Foffences against four boys at Monkton  
OL,17,FCombe School in Bath, Somerset, where  
OL,18,Fhe taught in the 1970s and 1980s.      
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
