OL,3,GNEWSATeacher tells jury naked photo was
OL,4,Ataken by pupil's spy cam               
OL,6,FJurors at Bristol Crown Court were told
OL,7,Fa photograph was taken of Barker in    
OL,8,F1988 by a pupil showing him lying      
OL,9,Funclothed on his bed. The defendant    
OL,10,Fclaims it was taken by a "special      
OL,11,Fcamera".                               
